{"skill":{"slug":"ai-news-collectors","displayName":"ai-news-collectors"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770615394344,"changelog":"collect my interesting  ai news","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":5294,"sha256":"f853f2ca3affda0efe14af78d16a1bfd82e75cae7c01ec431a4f09b69ebe313a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/sources.md","size":5141,"sha256":"2ed62b30bd1513356f36b388123cea89efad4b723bf6e11e0e35f911b077325c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1869,"sha256":"32c78aa7616078a8a7041035b12be7fde109c59c8ad08509789410d8fc6fd20e","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789054375985,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"d798f122b43f3cc8d1ae4064f0fb18306b62b97afed695cc6add4fe5a9ec8393","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/d798f122b43f3cc8d1ae4064f0fb18306b62b97afed695cc6add4fe5a9ec8393","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: ai-news-collectors\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle is classified as benign. The `SKILL.md` provides detailed instructions for an AI agent to perform multi-dimensional web searches and fetch web content for AI news aggregation. While this involves network access (`web_fetch`), it is directly and explicitly aligned with the stated purpose of collecting and summarizing news. There is no evidence of intentional harmful behavior, such as data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, or prompt injection attempts to subvert the agent for unauthorized actions. The `references/sources.md` file lists legitimate news sources and search keywords, further supporting the benign nature of the skill.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779162373771},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":21,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":3,"checkedAt":1789054375985},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Chinese AI-news research helper that uses broad web searching, with no evidence of hidden execution, persistence, credential access, or destructive behavior.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill expects multiple web searches and fetching third-party news/community sources, which is proportionate for current-news aggregation but should be understood as external browsing behavior.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The inspected artifact is Markdown guidance with a referenced Markdown source list; no install scripts, dependencies, executable payloads, or install-time commands were found.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The activation examples are somewhat broad for AI-current-events requests and the output is specified in Chinese, but the instructions remain focused on AI news collection and do not attempt to override safety rules, seize unrelated tasks, or hide behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, memory writes, background workers, privilege escalation, credential/session use, local indexing, or mutation authority appeared in the inspected files.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill’s stated purpose is to collect, cross-check, rank, and summarize recent AI news; its instructions for web search, source fetching, deduplication, and heat ranking directly support that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this if you want a Chinese-language AI news briefing workflow that will perform many web searches and read external sources. Users who prefer another output language or fewer searches may need to adjust the skill instructions before use.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The trigger language covers ordinary requests for recent AI news and trending AI products; this is broad but still aligned with the skill’s news-aggregation purpose and does not add high-impact authority.\n[SQP-3] expected: The skill directs Chinese output; this is disclosed and consistent with the Chinese-language artifact, though users who want another language should be aware of that limitation.\n[SQP-3] expected: The referenced source guide is Chinese-only and supports the same Chinese AI-news workflow; this is a usability/localization note rather than evidence of unsafe behavior.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789054375985}}}}}